+/**
+ * fscrypt_zeroout_range() - zero out a range of blocks in an encrypted file
+ * @inode: the file's inode
+ * @pos: the first file position (in bytes) to zero out
+ * @sector: the first sector to zero out
+ * @len: bytes to zero out
